        {
          "type": "chunk",
          "time": 1793118403559,
          "chunk": {
            "type": "block-end",
            "index": 0,
            "block": {
              "type": "reasoning",
              "text": "Midnight day 5, tick 25, at 铁匠铺. AP 10 probably. No new messages.\n\nI should decide: nothing productive. Perhaps use this tick to restock energy? At forge there's no rest action.\n\nOptions: stay and wait (end tick), or go home to rest (6 AP) — pointless since AP resets.\n\nMaybe I can use midnight productively: 小路 said he'd bring 1 ore for 2 coins. He's not here.\n\nI'll just keep the shop and end. But is there any repeatable useful action? Let me think about advertising 修镐 once more? I've done twice.\n\nAlternatively — could I proactively offer 悦 her pickaxe need by giving her an ore? No, she has 4.\n\nHmm, one more consideration: 悦 has 2 coins + 4 ore; if a broken pickaxe appears, she repairs. Fine.\n\nI think ending the tick is right. Keep it short.\n\nActually, one idea with real potential: ask 小砾 (who mines) whether her pickaxe is close to breaking / whether she's ever had a broken one before; and tell her: 我这儿有矿，你哪天镐崩了口，别急，拿来我两金一矿修好。Also ask if she'd sell her spare… she has none.\n\nNot much value.\n\nAlternatively, consider becoming a \"ore broker\" for 悦: she has 4 ore she can't sell (shop broke). 悦 could give me 4 ore, I'd... no cash.\n\nOK end the tick."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "chunk",
          "time": 1793118403559,
          "chunk": {
            "type": "block-end",
            "index": 1,
            "block": {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "夜深了，镇上安静得只剩风。铺子里的火我没让它灭，留了一膛暗红的炭。\n\n**午夜这一轮：**\n\n- 没客上门，也没新信来。小路说要把一块矿背来换两金，人还没到；阿石那边翻零件堆的事也还悬着。\n- 我把三块矿又在槽里码了一遍，锤子挂在顺手的地方，账本翻到今天这一页停住。\n\n**账目**：金币二、矿石三、铁料二，行动值满着没动。\n\n**守着两条**：一有坏镐头，我当天开炉；小路背矿来，我按两块一块收。其余的话不多说——夜里的铁匠铺，火在，人也在。"
            }
          }
        },
